        "TileImage": "$($repository 62e160fb-2f3f-422c-825d-5220467429ac).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning Agent Puppy. The ICA has gotten word that a high-priority target has been spotted in Sapienza. Michael Brumm, the French poacher. He has made a living hunting endangered and protected animals then making clothes with their pelts for wealthy customers.\r\rAn ICA agent hacked into his laptop using an unsecure WiFi connection and read his messages. He has been hired to make calico-skin gloves. He must be stopped before he can fullfill this commission. \r\rGood luck agent.",
